{"4239890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The White Lamb: No Shelter", "steam_appid": 4239890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast-paced FPS combat. You will take control of the protagonist <i>Ylymb</i>’s ego personality, and in the looping dreamscape torn apart by the <i>Persona Tempest</i>, explore the traumatic memories of the id (the Red Cloak) and the superego (the Blue Cloak). Through verbal persuasion and life-or-death choices, you will reconcile the three personalities and uncover the truth that plunged you into the abyss that fateful night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/d895413ccfeec06d6265a01ab3004ba8.avif?t=1772571370\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras_big/d895413ccfeec06d6265a01ab3004ba8.webp?t=1772571370 width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/16e2573eeb773ceeaa690098da6b01b5.avif?t=1772571370\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras_big/16e2573eeb773ceeaa690098da6b01b5.webp?t=1772571370 width=1560 height=768 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/cb33e468941742ee70d47ddc87efeafc.avif?t=1772571370\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras_big/cb33e468941742ee70d47ddc87efeafc.webp?t=1772571370 width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never-ending loop on the way home, a self torn apart—will you piece together the true <i>Ylymb</i> from the wreckage of memories? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/1e6decab3f91264ce71758879cb0f9d8.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/1e6decab3f91264ce71758879cb0f9d8.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/1e6decab3f91264ce71758879cb0f9d8.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/45c7600b7f0b47aa1e392cf2c74effb5.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/45c7600b7f0b47aa1e392cf2c74effb5.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/45c7600b7f0b47aa1e392cf2c74effb5.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/0f5d1d0ccbf237fefd2f07aefe2bfbfe.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/0f5d1d0ccbf237fefd2f07aefe2bfbfe.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/0f5d1d0ccbf237fefd2f07aefe2bfbfe.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the school dismissal bell twists into a never-ending curse, and your mirror image curls into a stranger’s grin—you’ll learn this truth: the deadliest prison isn’t made of walls. It’s buried in the depths of your subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/9215f67b738805c5c80843dda89d93dd.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/9215f67b738805c5c80843dda89d93dd.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/9215f67b738805c5c80843dda89d93dd.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the monsters your subconscious conjures up—they’re the brain’s way of protecting itself, barring you from digging into this memory. It’s nothing unusual, but you gotta find a way to keep them from messing with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/6079d9502ed28311be95a7b8f415feb6.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/6079d9502ed28311be95a7b8f415feb6.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/6079d9502ed28311be95a7b8f415feb6.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/3675ddba98e0ac3be5156d9c1043ba6e.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/3675ddba98e0ac3be5156d9c1043ba6e.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/3675ddba98e0ac3be5156d9c1043ba6e.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This place is filled with distorted school memories. You need to collect memory fragments, unlock the bullying trauma of the id (the Red Cloak) and the superego (the Blue Cloak), reconcile with your fragmented self through verbal persuasion and combat choices, and complete a journey of self-redemption that belongs to </strong><i>Ylymb</i><strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/5ddcbcd5f377608d2778e881726e97ed.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/5ddcbcd5f377608d2778e881726e97ed.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/5ddcbcd5f377608d2778e881726e97ed.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/064f4bc3b88fd55187be185a1aaefa39.poster.avif?t=1772571370\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/064f4bc3b88fd55187be185a1aaefa39.webm?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/064f4bc3b88fd55187be185a1aaefa39.mp4?t=1772571370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trauma is a scar carved into memory—redemption, though, is the light you grant yourself. Here, you’re more than a fighter; you’re the mender of your own wounds. When rage makes peace with restraint, when trauma is held with tenderness, can you guide the whole Ylymb out of the darkness of school bullying and toward a future lit by hope?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— Now, step into the red gate of light, confront the trauma without flinching, and begin your path to redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/ddb8bb106b190bd9b4993ebb8ecba007.avif?t=1772571370\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras_big/ddb8bb106b190bd9b4993ebb8ecba007.webp?t=1772571370 width=1560 height=768 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast-paced FPS combat. You will take control of the protagonist <i>Ylymb</i>’s ego personality, and in the looping dreamscape torn apart by the <i>Persona Tempest</i>, explore the traumatic memories of the id (the Red Cloak) and the superego (the Blue Cloak). Through verbal persuasion and life-or-death choices, you will reconcile the three personalities and uncover the truth that plunged you into the abyss that fateful night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/d895413ccfeec06d6265a01ab3004ba8.avif?t=1772571370\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras_big/d895413ccfeec06d6265a01ab3004ba8.webp?t=1772571370 width=1560 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239890/extras/16e2573eeb773ceea